# StoreKit config files can be tracked if you want; comment out if needed
# **/*.storekit
# Sound source files — 35MB of MP3/WAV/CAF masters at the repo root, kept
# out of the repo by "Keep sound source MP3s out of the repo". Anchored with
# a leading slash so it means *this* folder and nothing else: written bare as
# `download/` it also matched verg.app/download/, which silently excluded the
# website's own download page from the build.
/download/
